  data: {
    LLM: 'Lead from your long suits to pull cards. Save high cards to win point-bearing tricks. If you have La Politaine, try to obtain the lead and win three tricks in a row with 10-9-A.\n\nCount points in tricks to know when you have enough. Signal partner (e.g. tap table = good in that suit) if playing with conventions. Discard low cards on opponent point tricks.\n\nLa Politaine is riskyâ€”you may not get the lead or may be forced to break the sequence. Some variants require leading the Ace first when playing La Politaine to guarantee at least one point in the first trick. Coordinate with partner to establish leads.',
    Player: 'Lead from your long suits to pull cards. Save high cards to win point-bearing tricks. If you have La Politaine, try to obtain the lead and win three tricks in a row with 10-9-A.\n\nCount points in tricks to know when you have enough. Signal partner (e.g. tap table = good in that suit) if playing with conventions. Discard low cards on opponent point tricks.\n\nLa Politaine is riskyâ€”you may not get the lead or may be forced to break the sequence. Some variants require leading the Ace first when playing La Politaine to guarantee at least one point in the first trick. Coordinate with partner to establish leads.',
